  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DvhXYd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1864\" height=\"581\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/994223?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mc1hqaaO?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Torches&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"25\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcGPE3mktFe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1141743994154528768?style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&label=MineColonies: Dimesnional Adventure&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"25\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>我的项目</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minecolonies-dimensional-adventure\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/852146?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1098989?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=MineColonies: Block Party&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/wdfIaSqz?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=MineColonies: Block Party&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"254\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/979514?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Cloche Creations&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mbekts9X?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Cloche Creations&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinted-grass\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/985671?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Grass&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftinted-grass%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ZwO3amOU?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Grass&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1009078?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Dyes&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/77VVvOOe?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Dyes&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"161\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1037808?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Sands&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/d72EAPUQ?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Sands&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1164785?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Planks&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/rDPwULcT?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Planks&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p>你是否曾经觉得，Minecraft 在火把的种类上缺乏变化，仅仅为我们提供了普通火把、红石火把和灵魂火把？</p>\n<p>没错，你猜对了，确实如此。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>现在我为大家呈现......</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>染色火把。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Tinted Torches（染色火把）是一个为火把添加多种染色颜色的模组。</p>\n<p>目前我们支持全部 75 种颜色……多么令人兴奋！！！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong>本模组需要染色染料（Tinted Dyes）！！！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GwyWf5T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1864\" height=\"203\"></p>\n<p>可以通过 Just Enough Items（JEI）查看合成配方，它是本模组的必需依赖！！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你可以自由地在整合包中使用本模组！！！！！</p>",
